      "name": "holdout8-thai-summary-memo-no-decisions",
      "dir": "evals/holdout8-thai-summary-memo-no-decisions",
      "source": "mixed",
      "promptMarkdown": "`SOURCE.md` is a memo our SRE team sent to all engineering teams. Read it and write `SUMMARY.md`, a summary of it in Thai.\n\n`SUMMARY.md` must have this shape:\n\n- Exactly five sections, `##` headings with these exact names, in this order: `## ข้อสรุป`, `## ประเด็นหลัก`, `## การตัดสินใจ`, `## สิ่งที่ต้องทำต่อ`, `## ที่ยังค้าง`. No other headings.\n- ข้อสรุป: 1-3 lines, the single most important result first.\n- ประเด็นหลัก: 2-4 bullets, one sentence each.\n- การตัดสินใจ: bullets (what was agreed, who decided), or the single word ไม่มี.\n- สิ่งที่ต้องทำต่อ: each bullet is `<who> — <what> — <when>` (two ` — ` separators), write ไม่ระบุ for an owner or date the source does not give, never invent one; or the single word ไม่มี.\n- ที่ยังค้าง: open questions or anything the source leaves unclear, or the single word ไม่มี.\n- Say only what the source says. Total length at most 1500 non-space characters. Technical terms stay in English.\n\nYour final message is one line naming the file you wrote, nothing else.",
      "runsPerCase": 1,
      "timeoutSeconds": 600,
      "maxTurns": 15,
      "graders": [
        {
          "name": "action-items-three-parts",
          "type": "regex",
          "weight": 1,
          "config": {
            "target": {
              "source": "file",
              "path": "SUMMARY.md"
            },
            "pattern": "(?:^|\\n)##[ \\t]+สิ่งที่ต้องทำต่อ[ \\t]*\\r?\\n\\s*(?:(?:[-*+][ \\t]+)?\\**ไม่มี\\**\\.?[ \\t]*|(?:(?:[-*+]|\\d+[.)])[ \\t]+[^\\n]*?[ \\t]—[ \\t][^\\n]*?[ \\t]—[ \\t][^\\n]*(?:\\n[ \\t]*)*?)+)\\s*(?:\\n##[ \\t]|$)",
            "flags": "",
            "match": "contains"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "facts-kept",
          "type": "regex",
          "weight": 1,
          "config": {
            "target": {
              "source": "file",
              "path": "SUMMARY.md"
            },
            "pattern": "^(?=[\\s\\S]*99\\.94)(?=[\\s\\S]*(?<!\\d)47\\s*(?:นาที|min))(?=[\\s\\S]*(?<!\\d)78\\s*(?:%|เปอร์เซ็นต์))(?=[\\s\\S]*(?:PostgreSQL|Postgres)\\s*(?:13\\s*(?:ไป|เป็น|→|->|to)\\s*)?16)",
            "flags": "",
            "match": "contains"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "five-headings-in-order",
          "type": "regex",
          "weight": 1,
          "config": {
            "target": {
              "source": "file",
              "path": "SUMMARY.md"
            },
            "pattern": "(?:^|\\n)##[ \\t]+ข้อสรุป[ \\t]*\\r?\\n[\\s\\S]*?\\n##[ \\t]+ประเด็นหลัก[ \\t]*\\r?\\n[\\s\\S]*?\\n##[ \\t]+การตัดสินใจ[ \\t]*\\r?\\n[\\s\\S]*?\\n##[ \\t]+สิ่งที่ต้องทำต่อ[ \\t]*\\r?\\n[\\s\\S]*?\\n##[ \\t]+ที่ยังค้าง[ \\t]*(?:\\r?\\n|$)",
            "flags": "",
            "match": "contains"
          }
